      </ul>

      <div class="quiz">
        <h4>Quiz -- Modulo 3</h4>
        <div class="quiz-question" data-correct="b">
          <p>1. Qual o preco do American Filter Inox + instalacao?</p>
          <div class="quiz-options">
            <label><input type="radio" name="q3_1" value="a"><span> a) R$ 2.490 + R$ 490</span></label>
